UPRECS - uppercase a text field of every record in an array.

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD statement (UPRECS name, field)
  - TYPE records with string fields
  - reaching record text storage from a seed and editing it in place

Try it
  TYPE player : name$, score : ENDTYPE
    DIM team(2) AS player : ... fill team() ...
    UPRECS "TEAM", "NAME$"

Build it on the machine
  grow uprecs          # -> build/UPRECS.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as UPRECS.SED, ready to use.

